'''Mega Pinsir ex''' (Japanese: '''メガカイロスex''' ''Mega Kailios ex'') is a {{ct|Grass}} Basic {{TCGP|Mega Evolution Pokémon ex}} card in [[Pokémon Trading Card Game Pocket]]. It is part of the {{TCGP|Mega Rising}} expansion.

