==Trivia==
* This is the first card ever to feature Mega [[Pinsir (Pokémon)|Pinsir]], as the form hasn't been featured in [[Pokémon Trading Card Game|Pokémon TCG]] yet. 
* The special illustration rare print features Mega {{p|Pinsir}}, {{p|Wurmple}}, {{p|Silcoon}}, {{p|Cascoon}}, {{p|Dustox}}, {{p|Joltik}} and {{p|Galvantula}}.
===Origin===
*This card features [[Mega]] {{p|Pinsir}}.
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Sun}}.

